      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly frightening and deeply unsettling to experience those moments of losing your train of thought. Please know that these experiences can be distressing, and you are not alone in feeling this anxiety about your thoughts and self. If these episodes are becoming frequent or causing you significant distress, please consider speaking with a healthcare professional or therapist who can offer personalized support. They can help you understand what might be happening and provide tools to manage these feelings.",
